  "observations": [
    "Validation call receives input view in RCX and consumes AL bool. The virtual viewport IsValid(null) checks camera/frustum/port flags only.",
    "Checks original scalar validity on location/requested direction/up and X/Y/Z basis, all frustum fields, absolute width/height spans1e-18..1e18 inclusive. Projection2 additionally checks near>=2^-32; no normalization, enum coercion or far/near ordering is added.",
    "UUID helper collects bound display conduits, removes existing bindings to this viewport, changes viewport UUID, then re-adds missing bindings with viewport pointer/current UUID. This is a concrete display integration dependency, not just a UUID assignment."
